{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b8b6a2e4-6b1a-4c3a-9e2a-1f3a7c9d4a10",
    "name": "BuisnessOps API",
    "description": "Phase 0 (Foundations) API surface: auth, tenant/business/branch management, and role-based branch scoping. Backed by the Prisma/PostgreSQL schema in /Docs/database-table.md and the build order in /Docs/PROJECT_FLOW.md.\n\nHow to use:\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable (defaults to http://localhost:4000/api) and start the backend (`cd backend && npm run dev`).\n2. Run requests top-to-bottom within a folder, or use Collection Runner on the whole collection — each request's test script captures ids/tokens into collection variables (`ownerToken`, `businessId`, `branchAId`, etc.) for the next request to use automatically.\n3. `runId` is set once per run (from the current timestamp) and reused in generated emails/names so re-running the collection never collides with a previous run's data.\n\nThe \"Manager Scoping Checks\" folder is a Postman-runnable version of the Phase 0 exit-criteria test in backend/tests/tenant-isolation.test.js: a branch-scoped MANAGER can read their own branch but is blocked (403) from a sibling branch in the same business, even knowing its real id.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('runId')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('runId', Date.now().toString());",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "runId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ownerToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "ownerUserId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "managerToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "managerUserId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "businessId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "branchAId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "branchBId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "membershipId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "dataSourceId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "No auth, no tenant. Sanity check that the API is up."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 and status ok', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Signup (Owner)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } },
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner.{{runId}}@test.buisnessops.dev\",\n  \"password\": \"TestPass123!\",\n  \"name\": \"Demo Owner\",\n  \"businessName\": \"Demo Business {{runId}}\",\n  \"industry\": \"RETAIL\",\n  \"country\": \"IN\",\n  \"defaultCurrency\": \"INR\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/signup",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "signup"]
            },
            "description": "Creates the User, their Business, and the founding OWNER Membership in one transaction. Captures ownerToken/businessId/ownerUserId for later requests."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Owner signup succeeds (201)', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('ownerToken', body.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('businessId', body.business.id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('ownerUserId', body.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Signup (Manager Candidate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "body": {
